# Evidence is kept byte for byte (SHA256SUMS): no line-ending normalisation here.
* -text
# The logs end some lines in spaces (torch's warning), and deploy.log keeps curl's
# carriage returns and the terminal's colour codes: evidence, not style.
deploy.log whitespace=-blank-at-eol,cr-at-eol
environment-check.log whitespace=-blank-at-eol
pyg-kernels.log whitespace=-blank-at-eol
